# V1.4

# 2026-07-24

- Updated the alpine base image from 3.18 to 3.24
- Updated the Google Cloud CLI from 396.0.0 to 577.0.0 (gsutil 5.37)
- Added py3-crcmod so gsutil uses the compiled CRC32C implementation instead of the slow pure-Python fallback
- The Google Cloud CLI version and the target architecture (amd64 / arm64) are now build arguments
- Added timezone support through the TZ environment variable (defaults to UTC). TZ was previously
  ignored: if you already set it, the CRON_SCHEDULE now runs in that timezone instead of UTC

# V1.3

# 2022-08-18

- Changed base image from ubuntu to alpine
- Fix and rework the logging system (previously barely working)
- Updated the handling of the ACCESS_KEY and SECRET_KEY variable while configuring the boto.config file

